window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p></p><p>A collection of steamy, emotionally charged short stories where connection comes quickly — and lingers long after.</p><p></p> <p></p><p>They meet by chance. A lost dog. A rainstorm. A missed turn on a mountain trail. Brief moments — but they echo.</p><p></p> <p></p><p><i>Whispers Between Strangers</i> is a thoughtfully crafted collection of short stories exploring those fleeting but unforgettable encounters that shift something inside us. Each story holds a pulse of tension and tenderness — a quiet breath before a kiss, a hand held too long, a parting without a name.</p><p></p> <p></p><p>This is romance for those who crave emotion over explicitness, and presence over permanence. An audiobook for thoughtful hearts, midnight listeners, and those who believe that sometimes the shortest stories leave the deepest marks.</p><p></p>"; 
